    "display_title": "Official Review of Submission19037 by Reviewer LJA4",
    "content": {
      "summary": {
        "value": "This paper proposed an LLM pruning method, named SparseFW, which solves mask selection via convex relaxation and the Frank-Wolfe algorithm. Unfortunately, the paper exceeds the 9-page length limit and is therefore subject to desk rejection, according to the Author Guideline: https://iclr.cc/Conferences/2026/AuthorGuide."
      },
      "soundness": {
        "value": 3
      },
