      },
      "strengths": {
        "value": "This paper proposed a novel LLM pruning method, SparseFW, that transforms combinatorial LLM pruning into tractable convex optimization via relaxation and the Frank-Wolfe algorithm, which supports multiple sparsity patterns."
      },
      "weaknesses": {
        "value": "The paper exceeds the 9-page length limit, as mentioned in the Author Guideline: https://iclr.cc/Conferences/2026/AuthorGuide."
